"P3157378819" "War is our calling and our burden."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_AMBUSHING_COW_ACTIVE :
"P3606927312" "For the betterment of First Ward, I must put you to death."

// FIRSTWARD_COW_AMBUSHING_ToV_ACTIVE :
"P1995284539" "Your quest of vengeance ends here!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_AMBUSHING_ToV_ACTIVE :
"P3175356775" "The will of the Furies will avail you naught."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_AMBUSHING_ToV_ACTIVE :
"P1346015995" "I too follow a higher calling!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_AMBUSHING_ToV_ACTIVE :
"P3899293116" "Their thirst of violence is overwhelming!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_AMBUSHING_ToV_ACTIVE :
"P1932096803" "Sisters of Fury, your rage will gain you nothing!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_AMBUSHING_ToV_ACTIVE :
"P2437996723" "Argh! The air reeks of their hatred!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_AMBUSHING_ToV_ACTIVE :
"P2511941747" "I can feel their bloodlust in my bones."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_AMBUSHING_ToV_ACTIVE :
"P1938737964" "Too close to their anger, it is overpowering!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_AMBUSHING_ToV_ACTIVE :
"P1147527517" "No! Must...strike them down!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_AMBUSHING_ToV_ACTIVE :
"P2449491542" "Return to the Well, Sisters of Fury, your time has not yet come!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_AMBUSHING_ToV_ACTIVE :
"P2034287490" "Your ancient hatreds will only bring darkness."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_AMBUSHING_ToV_ACTIVE :
"P53632975" "This is not the Way!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_AMBUSHING_ToV_ACTIVE :
"P1521656739" "For too long have you sought to bring death to this world, we cannot allow that to happen."




// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_INACTIVE :
"P2924853487" "Get them to safety!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_INACTIVE :
"P1089841889" "I've got them, you take care of the D.U.S.T."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_INACTIVE :
"P3992801651" "Curse you to darkness! They're going after the Eltentowners."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_INACTIVE :
"P1357371431" "Your weapons are useless against our power!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_INACTIVE :
"P1318433357" "Ha! Attacking the Carnival of War was your first mistake."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_INACTIVE :
"P1749264710" "Attacking the unarmed like this? Cowards!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_INACTIVE :
"P3921201626" "You D.U.S.T. are pathetic."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_INACTIVE :
"P1270418901" "Your aggression is meaningless."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_DST_INACTIVE :
"P236224199" "If I were you, I'd run."


// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P767475736" "I can feel their bloodthirst in my bones."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P686911136" "For too long have you longed to bring death to this world, we are here to end it."


// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P2069217919" "Such insanity! They reek of it!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P279488787" "What could be the source of such madness?"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P263619337" "Their minds are as slippery as eels, there is no place to latch on!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P3298397388" "I can feel their madness whispering to me, I must fight it!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P2340317620" "There is no talking to them, we must rid the world of their disease."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P3361785674" "They are like a disease, we cannot let them escape!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P4293287693" "We cannot let their madness spread!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P4153337940" "I can feel their thoughts slipping past my defenses! I cannot last much longer!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P3785450240" "Argh! Their madness, like dirty fingers in my mind!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P3216594583" "They're in my thoughts! Like a knife in the dark!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P2745580231" "How can one stand against such mindless hate?"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P664479231" "I shall put you down like a feral beast!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_PROTECT_AGAINST_AWK_INACTIVE :
"P169492528" "I can feel your pain, let me end your misery."


// FIRSTWARD_COW_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P3166566671" "Stay still, let my power do the work."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P329408754" "You will feel the pain ebb, soon you will be well again."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P1030061760" "Quiet, let me do my work."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P735498838" "Easy there, you have been injured."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P1575856389" "I am here to help."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P3945075599" "Quit complaining. Others have fared far worse."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P2870883779" "They've suffered severe injuries, but my power should restore them."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P2996970456" "I do not know, there was a lot of damage, but I think I can heal them."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_MEDIC_INACTIVE :
"P4085973640" "Hm, four broken ribs, bruised spleen, minor internal bleeding."

// FIRSTWARD_COW_MEDIC_ALERTED :
"P3309842843" "Don't disturb me while I'm working."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_MEDIC_ALERTED :
"P1915441835" "Make sure there are no more hostiles, I have to keep this person stable."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_MEDIC_ALERTED :
"P3273701087" "I'm almost done here, just keep the area clear."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_MEDIC_ALERTED :
"P349093025" "My healing is nearly complete."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_MEDIC_ALERTED :
"P1542857217" "Thank you for getting here in time, I didn't know if my power would have been enough."

// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P100175844" "My wards will keep the Apparitions at bay. The others...I am not so sure."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P2716512605" "Do not disturb me while I work."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P3725634296" "These wards need to be reinforced."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P2910000799" "Hm....something is testing my defenses."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P231536257" "I can feel a...presence in the Night Ward...something powerful."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P342929788" "La luce protegge...le guide chiarea il senso...contro la nerezza."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_INACTIVE :
"P2888296898" "The power of darkness grows, our defenses grow weaker."

// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P3719109768" "The darkness approaches!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P806370312" "Do not let them through!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P516153872" "Get back! Something is trying to get through!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P1997016856" "Sisters, brothers! Our enemy approaches!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P1366206129" "Enemies at the gate!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P3203610060" "Get the innocent to safety, now!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P1720322616" "Why did we not foresee this?"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P1252683176" "Must...keep...them...back!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P3625779387" "Power...straining...must maintain defenses!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_ELTENGUARD_ALERTED :
"P2735493021" "To arms!"

// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_CASTER_INACTIVE :
"P4106982774" "The light shields her warriors. The light guides their aim. In the depths of darkness, the Light shows The Way."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_CASTER_INACTIVE :
"P324443909" "From the darkness of tyranny, we are the way to justice. From the shadows of despair, we are the anger of the righteous. The edge of our blades rends the shrouds of ignorance."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_CASTER_INACTIVE :
"P105956996" "Luce...guererro...destino...dovere."

// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_CASTER_ALERTED :
"P939506521" "Who interrupts the call to war?"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_CASTER_ALERTED :
"P2481334293" "Who dares?"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_CASTER_ALERTED :
"P2656340145" "What is this disturbance?"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_CASTER_ALERTED :
"P3556369415" "The ritual is interrupted."

// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P3618729661" "We can all feel it, something powerful is gathering in the shadows. It is not of the Well. It is not of Praetoria. It is ancient, elusive, and powerful."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P3985362411" "Brothers and sisters; the shadows draw near, and we must be prepared. We must not shrink from this challenge."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P537520262" "The people of Eltentown need us, even if they do not fully trust us. We are the tip of the spear against the oppressor."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P1719127485" "The people of Eltentown deserve to learn the truth, they deserve to take up arms against those who oppose them. We must show them the way."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P2933869946" "We go now to strike at the heart of vengeance before it consumes us all. We will be tested like never before."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P811560348" "Even if the people of Eltentown do not trust us, we will convince them eventually, or they will die."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P3250950955" "If Eltentown falls, our fall will come soon after."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P257863245" "Unless we cut out the cancer beneath First Ward, all of our plans will be for nothing. Remember that."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P2088175309" "The D.U.S.T. and the Seers are not our primary enemy here. Remember the Well. Remember what came before. There are powerful forces at work greater than Cole and his servants."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_INACTIVE :
"P588431293" "Our brothers and sisters are being subverted, and turn to the cause of mindless vengeance. We have a sacred duty to put them down before their madness infects us all."

// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_ALERTED :
"P2637219545" "Brothers, sisters, we have been discovered."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_ALERTED :
"P2967009201" "Who imposes upon our convocation?"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_ALERTED :
"P2298093749" "Who is this, who disturbs the Carnival of War?"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CONVOCATION_FLOATING_ALERTED :
"P3617463446" "Take your darkness from this place."

// FIRSTWARD_COW_SANCTUARY_INACTIVE :
"P3273298848" "I bring swift death to the oppressor."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_SANCTUARY_INACTIVE :
"P2818121699" "I am the blade, I am the hand the wields."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_SANCTUARY_INACTIVE :
"P2129090641" "Honor, valor, and glory to all who follow the path to war."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_SANCTUARY_INACTIVE :
"P2941097300" "Strike from the heart of the sun, The light blinds the oppressor."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_SANCTUARY_INACTIVE :
"P1249444426" "The darkness howls against the light."


// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P4059304954" "Sisters, brothers, turn from this course, it will only lead to your destruction."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P2846830169" "How could you turn against us, we are your family?"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P2671083702" "You will pay for your betrayal."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P2286958616" "You are being misled, they are only using you as a weapon against us."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P987404010" "Something is controlling you, fight it! This goes against everything we've fought for!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P3960074790" "Remember yourselves! This is not who you are!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P1499788766" "They lied to you! Listen to what you're saying!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P1849625393" "This is madness! Remember your oath!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P4233300785" "Stop this madness at once! The Carnival is your family!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P2281501803" "Withdraw now! I do not wish to destroy you!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P1897288325" "You are only serving the cause of darkness! Is this what you have become?"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P3055132111" "You are no longer my brothers and sisters. You are forcing me to destroy you!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_INACTIVE :
"P3432824134" "With great sadness I cast you down."

// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_ALERTED :
"P3916556351" "Do not interfere, this is an internal matter!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_ALERTED :
"P2061139063" "They have gone too far now, they are beyond redemption."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_ALERTED :
"P4199314312" "They do not represent the Carnival of Light, they have turned from the true Way."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_ALERTED :
"P764864383" "Darkness has consumed them, we must put a stop to this."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_COW_ALERTED :
"P3106199148" "Do not judge us for what we must do."

// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_TOV_INACTIVE :
"P4124945685" "For too long have you sought to bring death to this world, we are here to end it."








// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P3377522205" "These fragments contain great power, do not underestimate them."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P2087078581" "What kind of beings are these? Not ghosts, not spirits, but something other...."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P3023633365" "Rage, hatred, envy, spite, these are elementals of dark emotion."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P4026638977" "We must disperse these energies; left unchecked their kind can spread and possess others."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P2961526533" "They are like a disease, we must be the cure."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P1914859875" "Such powerful emotions, it hurts to be near them."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P2874073273" "Argh! I can feel their anger infecting me!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_BATTLE_APP_INACTIVE :
"P3309820424" "I can feel their power, it seeks to subvert me to its will."







// FIRSTWARD_COW_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P2427972614" "Today we eliminate the Talons patrols along the northern edge of the Forbidden Crags."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P1417400484" "Our former carnies have further shut themselves off from us. We must accept this and carry on in the hopes that they see our way as the correct way."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P116087292" "You have your orders, now move! We are the blade and the hand that wields. We are the tip of the spear. We are the Carnival of War!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P2357179898" "Do not be misled into believing that the Carnival of Light will not one day decide we are too great a threat to them to allow us to continue. We must always be on our guard."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P1543231826" "We have never faced an enemy like the Talons of Vengeance. They are an elemental force that cannot be reasoned with, only put down like animals."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_GETORDERS_READORDERS_INACTIVE :
"P4163098026" "Do not underestimate the Talons. They are bestial creatures driven by an ancient rage, but they are immortal, and patient to a degree that we cannot match."


// FIRSTWARD_COW_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P3821121107" "Yes, good. Again!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P72301455" "Are you truly ready for war? I need to see more conviction, prove to me your worthiness."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P388996166" "I am not seeing the true spirit of war within you. Let your rage guide your arm."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P3548519293" "The Talons will not hesitate to destroy you, do not give them any quarter."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P3248804182" "Let all concern for your safety flow from you like water from a vessel. You are an instrument of war, honed to a fine edge. Your only duty is to defeat your enemy."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P1878672298" "Your first duty is to defend this world from those that would destroy it. The Talons' duty is the see their ancient grudge realized, even if that means turning this world into a lifeless ball of ash."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P1077796638" "Now again, strike! Yes, good."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE :
"P2046750294" "Brothers and Sisters, your goal today is to take the life of a Talon of Vengeance. Do not think that they will be overly concerned with the loss of one of their own. They see it as the duty of each Talon to die in pursuit of their sacred charge."


// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_COW_SPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2207073224" "You do not tell me anything I do not already know."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_COW_SPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P911503820" "Yes, and what else?"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_COW_SPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1653721071" "You are to continue your intelligence gathering, we are preparing to strike soon."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_COW_SPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2961213487" "And what of the Carnival of Light, do they suspect?"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_COW_SPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3163268906" "I understand. Thank you for this information."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_COW_SPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P968405131" "I disagree."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_COW_SPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2236337641" "Quick with it, I do not have patience for your elaborations."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_COW_SPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2636568" "Do not allow your identity to be revealed. This information is too important to our mission."


// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3026263660" "The Carnival of Light has been sending scouts into the Sunken City. I think they're trying to figure out where you're training your new recruits."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P653482820" "Strange things are going on in the survivor stronghold. The Carnival of Light isn't letting on, but I think the defenses are starting to crumble."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1903555496" "The Carnival of Light has lost a few already. I don't think they can stomach this for much longer."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P283161125" "The Carnival of Light has enlisted outside help. Super-powered operatives. Some from the Powers Division, but others from somewhere else, outside the Empire maybe."

// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2868448180" "Oh no!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3260954757" "They can't know who I am!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1212528636" "I'm outta here!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4063720711" "Okay, goodbye."



// FIRSTWARD_COW_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P3401964132" "Hurry up, we don't have much time."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P1416659232" "What is taking so long?"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_HIDEOUTRAID_DOORSHOUT_INACTIVE :
"P3313781535" "Do be careful, we cannot afford to mess this up."


// FIRSTWARD_COW_LASTSTAND_RES_INACTIVE :
