// FIRSTWARD_COW_LASTSTAND_COV_ALERTED :
"P997869641" "Please, help us dispatch our fallen brothers and sisters."

// FIRSTWARD_COW_CAPTURE_DST_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P2718164947" "We hereby sentence you to death..."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CAPTURE_DST_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
