// FIRSTWARD_COW_CAPTURE_DST_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P903848043" "If the arbiter can now levy the charges against the accused."
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CAPTURE_DST_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P1090971665" "This is more justice than you have shown others."




// FIRSTWARD_COW_CAPTURE_COV_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P433879691" "Traitorous monster! You will soon see the price of your betrayal of the Carnival!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CAPTURE_COV_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P526027160" "You should never have turned your back upon us!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CAPTURE_COV_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P598610802" "We will see to it that the Talons and all who serve them are destroyed... starting with you!"
// FIRSTWARD_COW_CAPTURE_COV_READSCROLL_INACTIVE :
"P462435192" "You are beyond redemption, traitor, and you will soon suffer for what you have done!"

// FIRSTWARD_COW_CAPTURE_COV_READSCROLL_ALERTED :
